WEBVTT
NOTE
Draft captions from the recording script. Re-time every cue against the final recording before publishing.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:30.000
This tutorial deploys the three Mainstay contracts to Stellar testnet. You need Rust, the wasm32 target and the Stellar CLI.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Run ./scripts/build.sh. It compiles every contract to WebAssembly in target/wasm32-unknown-unknown/release.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:02:30.000
Set STELLAR_NETWORK to testnet. The deploy script refuses to run against any other network. It creates a deployer identity if one does not exist.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:03:30.000
Run ./scripts/deploy_testnet.sh. It deploys asset-registry, engineer-registry and lifecycle in that order.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:04:00.000
Each deploy prints a contract ID. Save them, because later calls need them.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:30.000
To confirm, call a read-only function such as get_admin on each contract. A valid response means the contract is live.
